  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192801</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>黒い月が化物に……
これがガルデニアなのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Ebony Moon just turned into a monster... is THAT really Gardenia?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41804</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192802</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。クリードが造りあげた、
スピリアを無限に吸収する
女王ゼロムだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. The queen xerom that infinitely absorbs all Spiria, created by Creed's hand.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192803</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぅぅ……
みんなあいつにスピリアを
喰われて死んじゃうのけ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uhh... are we all gonna die when it gobbles up out Spirias?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192804</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんな化物に人間が
逆らえる訳がない……
世界の終わりだわ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There is no way mere humans can stand against such a beast... this truly is the end of the world...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192805</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>させませんッ！
この命に代えて、ガルデニアは
わたくしが倒します!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I won't allow it! I shall sacrifice my life to stop Gardenia!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192806</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もう二度と、あいつに
わたくしの『家族』を奪われて
なるものですかッッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I cannot allow him to take my "family" from me again!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44176</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192807</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カル、オレを
抱えて飛べるよな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chal, can you fly me up there?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45148</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192808</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふっ、先ほどのお返しだ。
ガルデニアまででも
背負って飛んでやろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph, I must return the favor. I shall fly you Gardenia upon my back if I must.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192809</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あんな化物に……
ふたりだけで立ち向かう気!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>S-Such a horrifying creature... are you two really going to fight it alone?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45904</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192810</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>無謀は承知。だが、それが世界を
救う最後の術なら迷いはない。
それに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know this is reckless, However, if this is our last option in order to save the world, I will not hesitate. Besides...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46168</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192811</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりだけじゃない。
リチアの……みんなのスピリアが
オレたちを支えてくれる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not just us. We've got Lithia... and everyone's Spirias supporting us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46168</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192812</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……大切な桜を犠牲にして
アイオラさんの想いを守った
この里のみんなのスピリアも、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...As well as all the Spirias of the village that sacrificed their precious sakura in order to protect Iola's wish.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46416</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192813</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>待て。まだ方法はある。
自分はサンドリオン内で
フローラ様より機密データを得た</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, another option still remains. While in Cendrillon, I recieved classified data from Master Fluora. </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46416</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192814</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それによれば、カルセドニーの
飛行型ソーマは、ある特殊な
可能性を秘めているのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It states the Chalcedony's Soma possesses unique potential.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192815</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……特殊な可能性？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Unique potential?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192816</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>サンドリオンと同様の
大型飛行体へのエボルブだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is able to evolve into a large flying form comparable to Cendrillon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192817</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カル様のソーマが
空飛ぶ乗り物になるというのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you saying Lord Chal's Soma can evolve into a flying vehicle?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192818</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。
だが、そのためには
ふたつの素材アイテムが必要だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative, however two particular materials are required.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192819</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ひとつは外殻となる
煉獄竜ヴォルガジョーズの
『フレアホーン』……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>One is for the outer shell. We will need the "flare horn" from the purgatorial dragon Volgajoz...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192820</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そして、もうひとつは
触媒となる『ゼロムストーン』だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And the second is a catalyst, a "xerom stone".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192821</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>現在はクリードのみが生成可能な
ゼロムを操るための思念石だ。
インカローズも装備している</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A type of Will Stone for commanding xerom, which currently can only be produced by Creed. Incarose is equipped with some.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192822</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だ〜か〜ら〜、そのふたりが
空の上なんだってば！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah that's cool and all, but they just flew off, remember?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48884</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192823</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>聞け。クリードは原界人の体で
ゼロムを操るため、過去に数個の
ゼロムストーンをつくっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Allow me to explain. In order for Creed to manipulate xerom while in a Cellite host, he produced several xerom stones in the past.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192824</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうですわ！　ジルコニアも
ゼロムストーンを宝玉として
肌身離さず持っていたはずです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's it! Zirconia must have always worn his xerom stone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192825</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まさか、ゼロムストーンとは
先代ジルコニア様の宝玉——
『緋眼石』の事なのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it possibe Emperor Zirconia's "scarlet eyestone pendant" was a xerom stone?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192826</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カル様！
あの宝玉は
パライバ様が受け継ぎ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lord Chal! Her majesty Paraiba must have inherited that stone...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50548</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192827</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、ペンダントにして
私に贈ってくれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, she made it into a pendant and gifted it to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192828</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>森で拾ったペンダントか！
やった、もうひとつめの
素材が手に入った!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That must've been the pendant I picked up in the forest! Woohoo, we're one down!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192829</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そ、それが……あのペンダントは
パライバ様へ返却するよう頼んで
グロシュラー上将に渡してしまった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-Not exactly... I requested General Grossular return the pendant to her majesty.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192830</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はぁ〜〜〜!?
なにやってんのぉ、隊長？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whaaat~?! Why'd you have to go and do that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51860</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192831</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あっさりあきらめやがって！
面倒な事になっただろーが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's too early to be giving up! Even if it IS  a total pain in the ass.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52252</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192832</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……貴様ら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grr... how dare you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192833</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>カル様、こればかりは
反省してください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lord Chal, please take this opportunity to reflect on your actions.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192834</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バ、バイロクス……お前まで!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>B-Byrox... not YOU too?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192835</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、目指すは
カルセドニーのソーマの
エボルブ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, our new mission it evolving Chalcedony's Soma!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192836</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まず帝都に行って
ゼロムストーン——緋眼石の
ペンダントを手に入れよう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First things first, we need to head to the capital and get the scarlet eyestone pendant!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192837</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いいわね、ふたりとも？
わたしを置いて行くなんて
絶〜〜〜対に許さないんだから!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sound good? Better not make me leave you guys behind!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192839</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……は、はい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>..U-Understood!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192840</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……なぜ、この子たちは
こんな状況で笑えるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...How are these children laughing at a time like this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192841</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おかしな……
そして強い子たちでしょう？
まるで──</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They are strange... but incredibly strong children, wouldn't you agree? Besides...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55944</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192842</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んだ、傷つく事を恐れねぇ勇気と
人の痛みさ分かち合う優しさで
つながってる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, it takes courage to connect with others. To not fear being hurt by sharing you pain, and kindness all the same...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55944</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192843</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アイオラ姉ちゃんたちに
そっくりだべ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're just like Iola and her friends.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192844</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>里にこもった、おらたちが
忘れちまってた想いだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's a feeling we forgot when we shut our village away...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192845</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それどころか、当たりめぇに
お礼も言えなぐなってただよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In fact, we haven't even properly thanked you yet.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192846</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>教会……いんや
&lt;Kohaku&gt;の友達のみなさん。
里を守ってくれて、ありがとなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The church... no, all of Kohaku's friends. Thank you so much for protecting our village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192847</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>里の事ぁ、心配すんな！
化物どもに、リチア様じこみの
ド根性を見せてやるだよ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't gotta worry about us! We'll show them monsters what we're made of!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>11</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57600</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192848</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>里のオキテが
無意味になってしまった。
……全てあなたたちのせいです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our village law has become meaningless... this is all your fault.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192849</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あとで、まとめて
お説教すっから
必ず生ぎて帰ぇるだぞッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll need to give you the lecture of a lifetime, so you better come back alive, you hear?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58396</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192850</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとぉ、叔母ちゃん！
おらたち、けっぱってくるだよ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks auntie! We'll come back no matter what!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58524</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192851</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よ〜し、帰ったら
オレも一緒に叱られるよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alrighty, when we come back, I'll get in trouble with you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192852</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……後悔するぞ。
叔母さんの説教は
死ぬッッ〜〜〜ほど長げぇからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You're gonna regret you said that. Auntie's talking to's are sooo looong, they'll bore you to DEATH.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192853</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んだ……しかも
あの黒い月の化物より
怖ぇぇんだよぉ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... she might be even scarier than that Ebony Moon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192854</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;ッ、カイアッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I beg your pardon?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192855</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ソーマリンク！
ソーマ使いじゃない
人たちともリンクした!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A Somalink! You can link with people who aren't Somatics?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192856</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これは……これこそ
フローラ姉様がソーマに託した
人のスピリアの可能性ですわ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is... exactly what Fluora was hoping for Somas to be able to do. She wanted everyone's Spirias to link up to one another!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63740</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192857</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ああ、姉様が残した力が
こんなにあたたかく
わたくしを包んでくれている……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To think I would be wrapped in the warmth that my sister left behind...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>64404</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192858</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>姉さんだけじゃねぇよ。
これはリチアが
二千年かけて育てた力なんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not just her. This is thanks to your efforts over the past two-thousand years.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>65768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192859</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとう、&lt;Hisui&gt;……
ありがとう、わたくしの
家族たち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you, Hisui... Thank you, my family...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
